+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+- Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 with an empty `sales` collection.
+- Each sales row stores `ticket`, UTC `soldAt`, `dishId`, `qty`, and an
+  `ingredients` snapshot of scaled item quantities. Recipe edits do not change history.
+- Tickets already present before an import are skipped in full. New rows of
+  the same ticket are imported together. The whole file commits atomically.
+- Sale consumption movements use `soldAt` and `sale:<ticket>` as their reference.
